0 Step Bars (Quad Version)
0 Author: Ryan Gross
0 Purpose: Rectangles of decreasing height from left to right
0 Format: 4 <colour> x1 y1 z1 x2 y2 z2 x3 y3 z3 x4 y4 z4
0 Convention: -Y is up
0
0 Each "bar" is 20 wide (X), 20 deep (Z), height decreases left → right

0 --- Bar 1 (Leftmost, tallest, height = 40)
0 Base
4 7 0 0 0  20 0 0  20 0 20  0 0 20
0 Top
4 7 0 -40 0  20 -40 0  20 -40 20  0 -40 20
0 Front
4 7 0 0 0  20 0 0  20 -40 0  0 -40 0
0 Back
4 7 0 0 20  20 0 20  20 -40 20  0 -40 20
0 Left
4 7 0 0 0  0 0 20  0 -40 20  0 -40 0
0 Right
4 7 20 0 0  20 0 20  20 -40 20  20 -40 0

